      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "응? 여기는 공사 중이야.\n지금은 쉬고 있지만.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C751003F0020C5ECAE30B2940020ACF5C0AC0020C911C774C57C002E000AC9C0AE08C7400020C26CACE00020C788C9C0B9CC002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 홀로베이터를 이용하고 싶은 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020D640B85CBCA0C774D130B97C0020C774C6A9D558ACE00020C2F6C7400020AC70C57C003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미안하지만 아직 공사 중이야!\n게다가 지금은 쉬는 시간이기도 하고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8C548D558C9C0B9CC0020C544C9C10020ACF5C0AC0020C911C774C57C0021000AAC8CB2E4AC000020C9C0AE08C7400020C26CB2940020C2DCAC04C774AE30B3C40020D558ACE0002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아, 그렇지.\n나랑 포켓몬 승부 안 할래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544002C0020ADF8B807C9C0002E000AB098B7910020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD800020C5480020D560B798003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해 주면 그만 쉬고\n빠르게 공사를 마무리해 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCBA740020ADF8B9CC0020C26CACE0000ABE60B974AC8C0020ACF5C0ACB97C0020B9C8BB34B9ACD5740020C904AC8C002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부를 할 거라면\n내게 말을 걸어 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5600020AC70B77CBA74000AB0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부를 해 주면\n빠르게 공사를 마무리해 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5740020C8FCBA74000ABE60B974AC8C0020ACF5C0ACB97C0020B9C8BB34B9ACD5740020C904AC8C002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빠르게 이겨 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE60B974AC8C0020C774ACA80020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래?\n그럼 느긋하게 쉬어야겠다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798003F000AADF8B7FC0020B290AE0BD558AC8C0020C26CC5B4C57CACA0B2E4002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오, 승부해 주는 거야?\n그럼 간다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624002C0020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCB2940020AC70C57C003F000AADF8B7FC0020AC04B2E4002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "배틀 존이 출현 중일 때는\n홀로베이터를 수리할 수 없어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC30D2C00020C874C7740020CD9CD6040020C911C77C0020B54CB294000AD640B85CBCA0C774D130B97C0020C218B9ACD5600020C2180020C5C6C5B4002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋은 승부였어!\n쉬는 시간은 이쯤에서 끝내야겠네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC7400020C2B9BD80C600C5B40021000AC26CB2940020C2DCAC04C7400020C774CBE4C5D0C11C0020B05DB0B4C57CACA0B124002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 빠르게\n공사를 마무리해 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020BE60B974AC8C000AACF5C0ACB97C0020B9C8BB34B9ACD5740020C904AC8C002100100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "공사 완료!\n이제 홀로베이터를 써도 돼.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACF5C0AC0020C644B8CC0021000AC774C81C0020D640B85CBCA0C774D130B97C0020C368B3C40020B3FC002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "참고로 내가 배틀에서 내보낸 포켓몬은\n전부 옥상에서 잡은 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC38ACE0B85C0020B0B4AC000020BC30D2C0C5D0C11C0020B0B4BCF4B0B80020D3ECCF13BAACC740000AC804BD800020C625C0C1C5D0C11C0020C7A1C7400020AC70C57C002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론 일하다가 잡은 거라고!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n하도 집중하다 보니\n어느샌가 쉬는 시간이 되어 있었지만.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB8600020C77CD558B2E4AC000020C7A1C7400020AC70B77CACE0002100100001BE01000AD558B3C40020C9D1C911D558B2E40020BCF4B2C8000AC5B4B290C0CCAC000020C26CB2940020C2DCAC04C7740020B418C5B40020C788C5C8C9C0B9CC002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼 옥상에는\n다양한 포켓몬이 있으니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n너도 찾아 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC0020C625C0C1C5D0B294000AB2E4C591D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C788C73CB2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AB108B3C40020CC3EC5440020BD10002E00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 그렇고,\n진짜로 빠르게 공사를 마무리했지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020ADF8B807ACE0002C000AC9C4C9DCB85C0020BE60B974AC8C0020ACF5C0ACB97C0020B9C8BB34B9ACD588C9C0003F00100002011401550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "옥상에는 다양한 포켓몬이 있으니까\n너도 찾아 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
